IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BINT.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-RATE PIC S9(09)V9(06) COMP-3.
01 WS-DAILY-RATE PIC S9(01)V9(10) COMP-3.
01 WS-BASE PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
01 WS-WORK PIC S9(19)V9(06) COMP-3.

LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY "BINTP".

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BK-INT-REQ.
    MOVE "00" TO INT-RC
    MOVE SPACES TO INT-MSG
    MOVE 0 TO INT-INTEREST
    EVALUATE INT-OP
        WHEN "ACCRUE" PERFORM DO-ACCRUE
        WHEN "COMPOUND" PERFORM DO-COMPOUND
        WHEN "FEE" PERFORM DO-FEE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE "99" TO INT-RC
            MOVE "UNKNOWN INTEREST OP" TO INT-MSG
    END-EVALUATE
    GOBACK.

DO-ACCRUE.
    IF INT-BPS < 0 OR INT-BPS > 99999
        MOVE "20" TO INT-RC
        MOVE "RATE OUT OF RANGE" TO INT-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF INT-DAYS = 0
        MOVE "20" TO INT-RC
        MOVE "DAYS MUST BE POSITIVE" TO INT-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF INT-BASIS NOT = 360 AND INT-BASIS NOT = 365
        MOVE "20" TO INT-RC
        MOVE "BASIS MUST BE 360 OR 365" TO INT-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    COMPUTE WS-RATE = INT-BPS / 10000
    MOVE WS-RATE TO INT-RATE
    COMPUTE WS-WORK ROUNDED =
        INT-AMOUNT * WS-RATE * INT-DAYS / INT-BASIS
    MOVE WS-WORK TO INT-INTEREST.

DO-COMPOUND.
    IF INT-BPS < 0 OR INT-BPS > 99999
        MOVE "20" TO INT-RC
        MOVE "RATE OUT OF RANGE" TO INT-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF INT-DAYS = 0
        MOVE "20" TO INT-RC
        MOVE "DAYS MUST BE POSITIVE" TO INT-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF INT-BASIS NOT = 360 AND INT-BASIS NOT = 365
        MOVE "20" TO INT-RC
        MOVE "BASIS MUST BE 360 OR 365" TO INT-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    COMPUTE WS-RATE = INT-BPS / 10000
    MOVE WS-RATE TO INT-RATE
    COMPUTE WS-DAILY-RATE = WS-RATE / INT-BASIS
    MOVE INT-AMOUNT TO WS-BASE
    COMPUTE WS-WORK ROUNDED =
        WS-BASE * (1 + WS-DAILY-RATE) ** INT-DAYS
        ON SIZE ERROR
            MOVE "21" TO INT-RC
            MOVE "NUMERIC OVERFLOW IN COMPOUNDING" TO INT-MSG
            GOBACK
    END-COMPUTE
    SUBTRACT WS-BASE FROM WS-WORK
    MOVE WS-WORK TO INT-INTEREST.

DO-FEE.
    IF INT-FEE < 0
        MOVE "20" TO INT-RC
        MOVE "FEE MUST NOT BE NEGATIVE" TO INT-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE INT-FEE TO INT-INTEREST
    MOVE "00" TO INT-RC
    MOVE "FEE APPLIED" TO INT-MSG.
